<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Entitlements for the canopy-pty-host sidecar: none, on purpose.

  The host only owns PTYs and forks the user's shell. It does not run JIT code
  (allow-jit), record audio (audio-input), or load third-party libraries into
  itself (disable-library-validation). The children it forks are separate
  processes: the hardened runtime of the host does not constrain their own
  signing. The host also strips DYLD_* from its own environment, so
  allow-dyld-environment-variables would only widen what a long-lived process
  accepts. It is a long-lived process that outlives the app, so it gets the
  least the hardened runtime allows.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
</dict>
</plist>
